# Three-stage nested-Miller (NMC) op-amp, single-ended.
# Stage 1: NMOS pair M1a/M1b + PMOS mirror M2a/M2b -> o1 (VINP on the output side, inverting).
# Stage 2 (non-inverting): PMOS CS M5 (gate o1) into the NMOS diode M6a, mirrored by M6b
#   onto o2 against the PMOS current source M7.
# Stage 3 (inverting): NMOS CS M8 (gate o2) against the PMOS current source M11.
# Compensation: outer Miller Cm1 (VOUT -> o1), inner Miller Cm2 (VOUT -> o2).
# Bias: IREF diode M4; tail M3; M9 copies the reference into the PMOS diode M10 (gate pb).
NMOS M1a d1 VINN tail
NMOS M1b o1 VINP tail
PMOS M2a d1 d1 VDD
PMOS M2b o1 d1 VDD
NMOS M3 tail IREF VSS
NMOS M4 IREF IREF VSS
PMOS M5 d5 o1 VDD
NMOS M6a d5 d5 VSS
NMOS M6b o2 d5 VSS
PMOS M7 o2 pb VDD
NMOS M8 VOUT o2 VSS
PMOS M11 VOUT pb VDD
NMOS M9 pb IREF VSS
PMOS M10 pb pb VDD
C Cm1 o1 VOUT
C Cm2 o2 VOUT
